# Split Event Component

State machine implementation for 0xSplits contract event monitoring with controller and hash state tracking.

## Key Integration Pattern
- Implements state-based event types (Controller, HashInitialState, HashRecoveryState, HashUnknownState)
- Each event type provides formatted descriptions for multi-channel notifications

## Important Constraints
- Use efficient string building (strings.Builder) for all description methods
- Maintain consistent timestamp formatting across all event types